            "text": "pat technique ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "pat-technique"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Corn flour has no gluten, so rolling pins cause it to crack. Wet hands and patience are the only tools you need."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Add a small amount of plain flour or wholemeal flour if the dough is cracking too much. Traditional cooks use only corn flour."
          }
        ]
      },
